LEUM GOD El karinginyu nwe ke nga ngutalik.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"Nga tia sangeng sin tausin mwet lokoalok","poem":1},{"text":"Su rauniyula yen nukewa.","poem":2}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"Fahsru, LEUM GOD! Moliyula, God luk!","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Kom kai mwet lokoalok luk nukewa","poem":1},{"text":"Ac akmunasyalos, na wangin ku lalos in aklokoalokyeyu.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"Kutangla tuku sin LEUM GOD—","poem":1},{"text":"Lela tuh Elan akinsewowoye mwet lal.","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":3,"caller":"+","text":"eol mutal: liye Psa 2:6","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":4}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/kos_pub/PSA/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/kos_pub/PSA/4.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/kos_pub/PSA/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}